  "title": "Saint Patrick&#39;s Pistachio Cookies",
  "description": "These delicate little green cookies are made with pistachio nuts, pistachio pudding mix, and avocado for the perfect St. Patrick&#39;s day treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Kate's Kitchen"
  ],
